[* 
unix.rdn
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Ray Den
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

Purpose:
Cross-platform filesystem and working-directory helpers over the native unix module.

Loading behavior:
This module chooses the shared-library suffix from __sharedlib_ext and loads:
../nativelibs/unix(.so|.dylib|.dll)

Exports:
- pwd    : -> current working directory string
- exists : path -> boolean
- mkdir  : path -> true
- rmPath : path -> true
- ls     : path -> list of entry names

Examples:
"./libs/unix.rdn" load
pwd call print
"\n" print
"/tmp" exists call print
"\n" print
"/tmp" ls call len print
*]

"../nativelibs/unix" __sharedlib_ext to_string swap pop append loadnative

pwd defun
    cwd call
end

exists defun
    pathExists call
end

mkdir defun
    makeDir call
end

rmPath defun
    removePath call
end

ls defun
    listDir call
end
